    v\xF9i m\u01B0u \u0111\u1ED3 x\xE2m l\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE7a ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
    B\u1EAFc, ch\u1EA5m d\u1EE9t ho\xE0n to\xE0n h\u01A1n m\u1ED9t thi\xEAn ni\xEAn
    k\u1EF7 B\u1EAFc thu\u1ED9c v\xE0 m\u1EDF ra k\u1EF7 nguy\xEAn \u0111\u1ED9c
    l\u1EADp, t\u1EF1 ch\u1EE7 l\xE2u d\xE0i cho d\xE2n t\u1ED9c Vi\u1EC7t Nam."
  paintingSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1ffd88c6b054f94f8d8906c6a3e7d85, type: 3}
