  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PaintingInfo
  paintingTitle: "CH\u1ECCI TR\xC2U"
  paintingDescription: "Kh\u1EAFc h\u1ECDa tr\u1EADn \u0111\u1ECD s\u1EEBng d\u0169ng
    m\xE3nh gi\u1EEFa hai ch\xFA tr\xE2u ch\u1ECDi v\u1EA1m v\u1EE1 \u0111i\u1EC3m
    hoa v\u0103n xo\xE1y \xE2m d\u01B0\u01A1ng r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1 d\u01B0\u1EDBi b\u1EE9c
    ho\xE0nh \"H\xED S\xE1p H\u1ED9i\" (H\u1ED9i ch\u1ECDi tr\xE2u). T\xE1c ph\u1EA9m
    t\xF4n vinh tinh th\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\xF5 ki\xEAn c\u01B0\u1EDDng, s\u1EE9c
    m\u1EA1nh g\u1EAFn b\xF3 m\u1EADt thi\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi nh\xE0 n\xF4ng, g\u1EEDi
    g\u1EAFm \u01B0\u1EDBc nguy\u1EC7n c\u1EA7u cho b\u1EA3n l\xE0ng kh\u1ECFe m\u1EA1nh,
    m\xF9a m\xE0ng b\u1ED9i thu."
