  paintingTitle: "TI\u1EBEN T\xC0I"
  paintingDescription: "Kh\u1EAFc h\u1ECDa v\u1ECB th\u1EA7n ph\xFAc h\u1EADu trong
    ph\u1EA9m ph\u1EE5c quan l\u1EA1i tay n\xE2ng cu\u1ED1n th\u01B0 \"Ti\u1EBFn
    T\xE0i\", b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh \u0111\u1EC1 d\xF2ng ch\u1EEF \"T\xE0i h\u1EB1ng nguy\xEAn
    ch\xED\" (Ngu\u1ED3n ti\u1EC1n t\xE0i m\xE3i d\u1ED3i d\xE0o ch\u1EA3y v\u1EC1).
    Tranh th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xE1n b\xEAn c\u1EEDa tr\xE1i ng\xE0y
    T\u1EBFt nh\u1EB1m ngh\xEAnh \u0111\xF3n t\xE0i l\u1ED9c, c\u1EA7u cho gia ch\u1EE7
    bu\xF4n may b\xE1n \u0111\u1EAFt, c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c kinh doanh lu\xF4n th\u1ECBnh
    v\u01B0\u1EE3ng ph\xE1t \u0111\u1EA1t."
