    sen h\xE9 n\u1EDF thu\u1EA7n khi\u1EBFt. Ch\xFA v\u1ECBt t\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\u01B0ng
    cho cu\u1ED9c s\u1ED1ng \xEAm \u1EA5m, sung t\xFAc v\xE0 thu\u1EADn h\xF2a; hoa
    sen bi\u1EC3u th\u1ECB cho ph\u1EA9m h\u1EA1nh thanh tao, b\xECnh d\u1ECB. B\u1EE9c
