  paintingTitle: "M\xDAA L\xC2N"
  paintingDescription: "T\xE1i hi\u1EC7n kh\xF4ng kh\xED h\u1ED9i h\xE8 r\u1ED9n
    r\xE3 t\u01B0ng b\u1EEBng v\u1EDBi m\xE0n m\xFAa l\xE2n d\u0169ng m\xE3nh, bao
    quanh l\xE0 \u0111o\xE0n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE1nh tr\u1ED1ng, khua chi\xEAng,
    gi\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EDD reo h\xF2. \u0110i\u1EC7u m\xFAa l\xE2n trong v\u0103n
    h\xF3a d\xE2n gian mang \xFD ngh\u0129a xua \u0111u\u1ED5i t\xE0 kh\xED, r\u01B0\u1EDBc
    \u0111i\u1EC1m l\xE0nh, \u0111\xF3n may m\u1EAFn v\xE0 c\u1EA7u ch\xFAc m\u1ED9t
    n\u0103m m\u01B0a thu\u1EADn gi\xF3 h\xF2a, l\xE0m \u0103n hanh th\xF4ng ph\xE1t
    \u0111\u1EA1t."
