  paintingTitle: "HAI B\xC0 TR\u01AFNG C\u01AF\u1EE0I VOI"
  paintingDescription: "T\xE1i hi\u1EC7n cu\u1ED9c kh\u1EDFi ngh\u0129a oanh li\u1EC7t
    n\u0103m 40 sau C\xF4ng nguy\xEAn c\u1EE7a Tr\u01B0ng Tr\u1EAFc v\xE0 Tr\u01B0ng
    Nh\u1ECB c\u01B0\u1EE1i voi gi\u01B0\u01A1ng g\u01B0\u01A1m xung tr\u1EADn, qu\xE2n
    Nam d\u0169ng m\xE3nh ti\u1EBFn l\xEAn khi\u1EBFn gi\u1EB7c ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
    B\u1EAFc kinh h\u1ED3n b\u1EA1t v\xEDa. B\u1EE9c tranh th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n l\xF2ng
    t\u1EF1 h\xE0o d\xE2n t\u1ED9c s\xE2u s\u1EAFc, tinh th\u1EA7n qu\u1EADt kh\u1EDFi
    gi\xE0nh l\u1EA1i ch\u1EE7 quy\u1EC1n giang s\u01A1n sau th\u1EDDi k\u1EF3 d\xE0i
    B\u1EAFc thu\u1ED9c."
  paintingSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9e9cdefc41c2f8d49a9abaf9dd0e3f89, type: 3}
